  _className: Mechanic
  _defaultAttackRange: 0
  _classDescription: "Xavier's Base Class: \n- Summon things to fight/aid. \n- Variable
    options, but tends to be a slow ramp -> big-reward type class in battle.\n- The
    majority of summons affect and scale off of Technical (TEC): A unit's magical
    power."
  effects:
  - 'Offensive: Gain 50% TECH stat boost. RECONSTRUCT all bots that RUPTURE this
    turn.'
  - 'Defensive: Gain 30% RESISTANCE. Double the defense a microbot provides.'
  explanations:
  - 'Offensive: Riffing on the other two ideas, allows the mechanic to go big without
    being too punished. Really like this one (no bias).'
  - 'Defensive: Using defend already can recall all bots, so they can either spend
    their turn distributing bots to allies then use this or can defend, in doing
    so recalling their bots to prepare for an incoming attack.'
